<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A3.SS2.SSS0.Px6" title="In C.2 Proof of local quasi-concavity of the reward ‣ Appendix C Proof of guarantee as an imitation reward ‣ Reference Grounded Skill Discovery" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Conclusion</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
